 <h3><u>Sakina mar gai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>KEHTA THA TADAPKE NATAWA’N, EY PHUPI SAKINA MAR GAEI<br> KEHTE KEHTE BABA BABA JAA’N, EY PHUPI SAKINA MAR GAEI</p> 
  <p>1-KAISE ME YE GHAM KAROO’N SEHAN, BOLTI NAHI MERI BEHAN<br> HO GAEI KHAMOSH NEEMJAA’N EY PHUPI SAKINA MAR GAEI….</p> 
  <p>2-KARBALA SE JISKI BE KHATA, EY PHUPI HUI THI IBTEDA<br> KHATM HO GAEI WO DASTAA’N, EY PHUPI………………………………</p> 
  <p>3-ZINDAGI TAMAM HO GAEI, SHAM ME HI SHAM HO GAEI<br> BAND HO GAEI’N HAIN SISKIYA’N, EY PHUPI…………………………..</p> 
  <p>4-BABA JAA’N KE SAR PE RAKH KE SAR,KEH RAHI THI ROKE NOHAGAR, KAB<br> TALAK SAHOO’N ME SAKHTIYA’N, EY PHUPI………………………….</p> 
  <p>5-KEH RAHI THI ROKE NOHAGAR, LE GAYA HAI SHIMR CHINKAR, APNE JO<br> DEE’N THEE’N BALIYA’N. EY PHUPI………………………………………</p> 
  <p>6-GHAMZADA BEHAN KI TA HAYAT,YAD AAYEGI HAR AIK BAAT<br> KAR NA PAONGA JINHE BAYA’N, EY PHUPI………………………………..</p> 
  <p>7-BAAD E QATL E SHAHE KARBALA,ZINDAGI SE THA JISE GILA<br> SO GAEI WO AAJ NOHE KHUWA’N, EYPHUPI……………………………………..7</p> 
  <p>8-HATHKADI HAI MERE HATH ME,KOI BHI NAHI HAI SATH ME<br> DAFN KAISE ME KAROO’N YAHA’N,EY PHUPI…………………………………………8</p> 
  <p>9-ASIF E HAZEE’N BA SHORO SHAIN,AAMIR E HAZEE’N YE SUNKE BAIN, GIR<br> GAEI TADAP KE EK MAA’N EY PHUPI&nbsp; SAKINA MAR GAI…………</p> 
